TITLE Albite kinetics + fixed-pressure H2S(g), 200 C
SOLUTION 1
    temp 200
    pH 2 charge
    Fe(+3) 4e-3
    Fe(+2) 4e-3
    -water 1

GAS_PHASE 1
    -fixed_pressure
    -pressure 5
    H2S(g) 5

KINETICS 1
    Albite
        -m0 1
        -m  1
        -parms 1.0 10
        -tol 1e-12
    -steps 10 100

SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file sel.txt
    -reset false
    -time true
    -step true
    -totals S(-2)

END
